```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Main as Parent Process (Watchdog)
    participant T1 as Thread 1
    participant B as Barrier (Capacity: 2)
    participant T2 as Thread 2
    participant LA as Lock A (Mutex)
    participant LB as Lock B (Mutex)

    Main->>T1: Spawn & Start
    Main->>T2: Spawn & Start
    Note over Main: Watchdog timer set to 3.0 seconds

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over T1, LA: Step 1: Lock A Acquisition
        T1->>LA: lock_a.acquire()
        LA-->>T1: Granted (Lock A held by T1)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 238)
        Note over T2, LB: Step 2: Lock B Acquisition
        T2->>LB: lock_b.acquire()
        LB-->>T2: Granted (Lock B held by T2)
    end

    rect rgb(245, 245, 245)
        Note over T1, T2: Step 3: Deterministic Synchronization
        T1->>B: barrier.wait() (Arrived 1/2)
        T2->>B: barrier.wait() (Arrived 2/2)
        B-->>T1: Barrier Tripped / Released
        B-->>T2: Barrier Tripped / Released
    end

    rect rgb(255, 235, 238)
        Note over T1, LB: Step 4: Circular Contention
        T1->>LB: lock_b.acquire()
        Note over T1, LB: BLOCKED! (Lock B held by T2)
        T2->>LA: lock_a.acquire()
        Note over T2, LA: BLOCKED! (Lock A held by T1)
    end

    Note over T1, T2: Indefinite Deadlock (Both threads asleep in wait-queue)

    rect rgb(255, 255, 224)
        Note over Main: Step 5: Watchdog Expiration
        Main->>Main: process.join(timeout=3) expires
        Main->>Main: process.is_alive() == True
        Main->>T1: process.terminate() [SIGTERM]
        Main->>T2: Terminated
        Note over Main: Prints "DEADLOCK DETECTED!"
    end
```
